    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"AdminPage-AbouttheFeature\">About the Feature</h2><p>Admin module has features like <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Import+Data\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSV Upload</a>, <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Export+Data\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSV Export</a> and <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/display/BAH/Authoring+Order+Sets\" rel=\"nofollow\">Order Set</a>.</p><h2 id=\"AdminPage-UsedBy\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Used By</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Administrator of the hospital uses this feature.</span></p><h2 id=\"AdminPage-HowisitUsed?\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">How is it Used?</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Select the Admin module from the home dashboard to use it.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313588/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.17.27%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460707743601&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=447&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/53313588/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.17.27%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460707743601&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53837921\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-04-15 at 1.17.27 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"53313588\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"2536e9fd-36bc-4eb2-9c7e-7a449891ee30\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313588/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.17.27%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460707743601&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=894&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313588/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.17.27%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460707743601&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=447&amp;height=400 1x\"></span> </span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">On accessing the Admin module, three options will be available. Please refer to the links below on using them</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"23cf5595-a582-48cb-a399-ce95c42236f0\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313622/Export+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313622\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Export Data</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313590/Import+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313590\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Import Data</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/49545249/Authoring+Order+Sets\" data-linked-resource-id=\"49545249\" data-linked-resource-version=\"17\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Authoring Order Sets</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/712507393/Ward+Management+Admin+Console\" data-linked-resource-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Ward Management Admin Console</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2241462320/View+Audit+Logs+Patient+Data+Access+Logs\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2241462320\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">View Audit Logs / Patient Data Access Logs</a></li></ul><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6462b5e2-1d86-451d-a8c5-c39c2f99335c\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni configuration for each implementation can vary drastically. The screens and workflows may not be constant across all installations of Bahmni.</span></strong></p></div></div><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"af80166f-61d3-4ee1-a7f9-d1ea0b9c28c4\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Sections</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"0c945e18-35b4-47d3-a0b5-8d1378540c40\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313622/Export+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313622\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Export Data</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313590/Import+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313590\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Import Data</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/49545249/Authoring+Order+Sets\" data-linked-resource-id=\"49545249\" data-linked-resource-version=\"17\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Authoring Order Sets</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/712507393/Ward+Management+Admin+Console\" data-linked-resource-id=\"712507393\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Ward Management Admin Console</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2241462320/View+Audit+Logs+Patient+Data+Access+Logs\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2241462320\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">View Audit Logs / Patient Data Access Logs</a></li></ul><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313558/Administrator+s+Page\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313558\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Admin Page - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3fe3feef-06ea-4aac-b9a1-a6bbe83b0bec\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Implemnentation Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313563/Bahmni+Administration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313563\" data-linked-resource-version=\"7\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Admin Page - Implementer's Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
